able side." (at 20 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "5484c979-b41b-5660-be35-f1ad5d426c9b"))(text "Place between transformer and PHY with short ground returns and no long shunt stubs." (at 20 158 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "38141ad4-6bb8-54b6-ab7b-c725946de9b1"))(text "Nominal line capacitance 0.5pF; include land pattern and clamp loading in MDI layout review." (at 20 166 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "e719c0ec-86b7-54fd-8733-5d30858eeb6d"))(text "5.5V stand-off is not a guarantee that the PHY survives every surge. Check residual stress experimentally." (at 20 174 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "879658a2-5840-5c9e-933a-fae80b0e4790"))(text "Cable-side isolation is retained. Do not move these ground-referenced clamps across the transformer." (at 20 182 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "157665b4-89e0-50cd-8db0-62e4c17d7db2"))(text "System ESD/EFT/surge performance requires finished layout and prototype tests; component rating is insufficient." (at 20 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "bcc24ec2-1320-5225-b2d5-1bf383b06a96"))(text "Sources: TI SLVSBO7L pin table, DQA package drawing; TI system-level ESD guide SSZB130 Ethernet topology." (at 20 198 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "bf70aa24-58a5-5dc7-9d62-1c63ab8ab160")))
